    "# One-Step Detection Model (Main)\n",
    "\n",
    "The primary one-step fall detection model for this project. This implementation provides end-to-end fall detection in a single step, classifying persons as engaged in fall, sit, or walk activities.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Model Approach:**\n",
    "- Optimized architecture for improved accuracy and robustness\n",
    "- Custom data augmentation pipeline\n",
    "- Refined hyperparameters and training schedule\n",
    "- Focus on robustness and generalization across varying lighting conditions\n",
    "- Direct object detection and classification in one unified model\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook provides a complete end-to-end workflow:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. confirm the project environment and dependencies\n",
    "2. verify the dataset structure\n",
    "3. train the one-step detection model\n",
    "4. evaluate the trained model on the held-out test set\n",
    "5. save report-ready outputs for comparison with the two-step architecture"
   ]
  },
